      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ORANA JOEL (1) finds it hard to win but has a consistent overall record, having placed seven of 15 career runs. Finished third (18.64) at this track last time making it five minors on end. Won at his only start from this draw. Key chance in this line up. ZERO DARK THIRTY (7) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (23.13) at this track. Form here sound including two wins. Hard to beat again. RED ROCK LOTUS (4) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (18.77) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Should be thereabouts. PIPPI (8) was in the money last start at this track and distance - poses a threat again.",
